{"seq":9,"slug":"health-communication","title":"健康传播","stage":"DONE","category":"media-communication","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"健康传播\">健康传播</h1><p>一支麻疹疫苗在 1998 年被一篇后来被撤稿的论文错误地与自闭症挂钩，二十多年后，这条早已被科学界反复证伪的说法仍在社交平台上流转，并在 2024 至 2025 年间助推麻疹在美国、加拿大、英国等高收入国家重新夺去儿童的生命。这个事实道出了健康传播的根本难题：让一条正确的健康信息被人听见、相信并据以行动，远比生产这条信息本身要难得多。健康传播这门学科，研究的正是「如何有效地传播健康信息」——从一对一的医患对话，到覆盖全国的疫苗运动，再到一场突发疫情中政府对公众的紧急喊话。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 沿着一条由浅入深的主线展开，分四章递进。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」搭建理论地基。它先界定健康传播是什么、有哪些经典传播模型与分析层次；再讲清驱动健康行为的几大心理理论——健康信念模型、计划行为理论、扩展平行过程模型；最后落到风险传播，解释人为什么对客观上很小的风险感到恐惧、对很大的风险却麻木。没有这一章，后面所有的「术」都将失去「道」。</p>\n<p>第二章「媒介与渠道」回答「通过什么渠道传播」。它按传播半径由大到小、再到融合，依次讲健康运动与社会营销（面向大众）、医患沟通与健康素养（面向个体）、数字健康传播（移动健康、远程医疗、健康 App）。同一套行为理论，在不同渠道上有截然不同的落地方式。</p>\n<p>第三章「议题与挑战」直面健康传播最棘手的三个现实困境：健康错误信息与信息疫情、健康不平等与文化差异、公共卫生危机传播。这一章解释为什么「把正确信息说出来」远远不够。</p>\n<p>第四章「前沿」聚焦 2025 至 2026 年的技术拐点：大语言模型既是放大错误信息的新威胁，也是个性化健康沟通的新工具；社交媒体重塑了健康信息的生产与扩散结构；而精准健康传播试图把前三章的一切——理论、渠道、对挑战的认识——融合成「在对的时间、用对的方式、对对的人说对的话」。最后一篇也是全 hub 的收束，回望四条主线如何汇流，并展望未来。</p>\n<p>四章之间不是并列的拼盘，而是一条逻辑链：先懂人为何如此行动（基础），再选对渠道（媒介），认清现实阻力（挑战），最后用新技术把整套方法推向精准（前沿）。读者既可顺序通读，也可从任一篇出发，沿文内的交叉链接织成的知识网自由穿行。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-core-concepts","title":"健康传播导论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/foundations/intro-and-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-behavior-theories","title":"健康行为理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/foundations/health-behavior-theories"},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-communication","title":"风险传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/foundations/risk-communication"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-channels","title":"媒介与渠道","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/media-channels","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"campaigns-social-marketing","title":"健康运动与社会营销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/media-channels/campaigns-social-marketing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"provider-patient-communication","title":"医患沟通与健康素养","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/media-channels/provider-patient-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-health-communication","title":"数字健康传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/media-channels/digital-health-communication"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"issues-challenges","title":"议题与挑战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/issues-challenges","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"health-misinformation","title":"健康错误信息与信息疫情","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/issues-challenges/health-misinformation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-disparities-culture","title":"健康不平等与文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/issues-challenges/health-disparities-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crisis-emergency-communication","title":"公共卫生危机传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/issues-challenges/crisis-emergency-communication"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontiers","title":"前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-health-communication","title":"AI与健康传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/frontiers/ai-health-communication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-media-health","title":"社交媒体与健康","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/frontiers/social-media-health"},{"seq":3,"slug":"precision-health-communication-future","title":"精准健康传播与未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/health-communication/frontiers/precision-health-communication-future"}]}]}